snp3.6:47.3 starts: delight.
snp3.6:47.4 none
snp5.13:1.1 starts: I entreat the one who has
snp5.13:1.3 starts: abandoned delight—crossed over the flood, released;
snp5.13:1.4 starts: abandoned theory—very intelligent:
snp5.13:1.5 starts: Having heard the Nāga, they will leave—
snp5.13:2.1 starts: the many gathered
snp5.13:2.2 starts: in hopes of your words.
snp5.13:2.3 starts: So tell them, please,
snp5.13:2.4 starts: how this Dhamma has
snp5.13:3.1 starts: The Buddha:
snp5.13:3.3 starts: above, below,
snp5.13:3.4 starts: For whatever people cling to in the world,
snp5.13:3.5 starts: it’s through that
